      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This work shows the results obtained verifying the analgesic ability of the Laser therapy in clinical practice. We are now locating new possibilities of treatment from therapy records taken by previous researchers. We are thankful for the efficient therapy of the semi conductor Ga As Laser and the possibility that we have through the use of such an instrument to reduce the supply of the anti inflammatory medicines in patients that experience pain."},
